# Architecture and diagrams

Service-specific ADRs override this file. Implementation: `backend.mdc`, `frontend-web.mdc`, `api-and-events.mdc`.

## ADR lifecycle

- One decision per file under `docs/agents-v0/adr/<NN>-<slug>.md`.
- Status is `Proposed`, `Accepted`, or `Superseded by ADR <NN>`.
- An `Accepted` ADR stays. A later decision writes the next file and changes only the old Status line.
- `docs/agents-v0/adr/0000-inherited-decisions.md` stays the as-is record (`Accepted (inherited)`). Overriding an inherited decision is a new ADR.
- `.agents-v0/ci/check-adr.sh` rejects a rewritten accepted ADR once an `Accepted` revision is in git history. Until that revision exists, it checks status and successors only. The design pin hashes the ADR a design cites.

